1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Obituary:
2 CONT https://www.altmeyerfuneralandcremation.com/obituaries/Susan-Linda-Proescher?obId=42100686
2 CONT
2 CONT Susan Linda “Cookie” Proescher (née Flasterstein) - a loving mother, grandmother, and friend - passed away on Saturday, April 19, 2025, in Norfolk, Virginia. Susan was born and raised in Brooklyn, New York, and was a long-time res
2 CONC ident of Virginia. She was 83 years old.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Susan's kindness, wit, and vivacity brought joy to all. She was loved by her family and countless friends, whose lives were forever uplifted by her empathy, wisdom, and generosity.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Susan graduated from the Metropolitan Vocational High School of Performing Arts in Manhattan. She had a bachelor's degree from New York University and a master's in Russian from Georgetown University. She acted in theater and did 
2 CONC modeling, and worked many years as a language instructor in Norfolk and Virginia Beach, teaching Russian and Spanish.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Susan was preceded in death by her husband Richard Proescher, her husband Hsiao-chi David Yu, her father Samuel Flasterstein (Nachma Simcha Zimmel), her mother Selma Beatrice Friedman Flasterstein (Tzima Tzipporah), and her brothe
2 CONC r Stuart Flasterstein.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Susan is mourned by her daughters Lulan Yu (Harrison Trent Nicholas, III), Alyse (Milomir) Radenovic, and Rachel Yu (Doru Florescu);
2 CONT
2 CONT Her sister Sheila Flasterstein Friedman;
2 CONT
2 CONT And her grandchildren Violette (Brandon) Rawlyk, Spasenija Radenovic, Elka Nicholas-Yu, Zachary Nicholas, and Daniel Florescu.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Susan’s Hebrew name was Minda Zelda bat Nachma Simcha Zimmel v’Tzima Tzipporah (Alternately, Minda Zelda Miriam).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Susan was buried at Forest Lawn Cemetery in Norfolk, Virginia. At Susan’s request, no public funeral services are to be held.
