1 BIRT
2 DATE 742
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Zeng Jiu (曾舊), the 2nd son of Zeng Cheng (曾丞), was also named Wei Sheng (惟生). He was born in 742 AD. In 776 AD, he passed the government broad exam and became a scholar (進士  Jinshi ). He was promoted to different p
2 CONC osition ushc as Counselor of the Palace with purple decorations (金紫光祿大夫), Imperial Secretariat (檢校尚書), Chief Administrator (左僕射) and Palace Secretary (中書門下). The emperor honored him with the title of Duke of Lu State (魯郡開國公). In 8
2 CONC 07 AD,he moved from Jiyang (吉陽,present Yongfeng county Jiangxi), to Yun Yi village (雲益鄉) Wang Xian Li Jiao (望仙里角). In 830 AD, he passed away and was buried at Zhongyi Township (忠義鄉) Yin Gui Ridge(銀櫃嶺).
2 CONT
2 CONT 舊公, 丞次子, 字惟生, 生於天寶元年壬午,登大歷丙辰進士第, 累官至金紫光祿大夫,檢校尚書,左僕射,同中書門下平章事赠上柱國,魯郡開國公. 元和二年由吉陽徒雲益鄉望仙里角陂大坑, 今云大垥,大和四年. 葬忠義鄉, 銀櫃嶺, 人形趾丙午即十二都另雞嶺.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married to Wang Shi (王氏) and later to Zhao Shi (趙氏). Both were buried at Qing Xia (庆下), Jia Chai Xing (金釵形). He married a third time to Lu Shi (呂氏). She was buried at Xin'gan county (新淦縣), Linjiang Fu (臨江府), behind Bi Yun Hill 
2 CONC Temple (碧雲山寺). They had 3 sons: the eldest You(宥) [also named Quan 槫 had 1 son called Liang (亮)], the second Kuǎng (儣), and the third Dé (德).
2 CONT
2 CONT 配王氏及继娶趙氏, 合葬庆下金釵形. 三娶呂氏勒葬臨江府新淦縣, 碧雲山寺後, 獅子抱毬形亥向      生子三名, 長宥(宥字槫,生子一名: 亮), 次儣，三德.
