1 NAME 明 /Zēng 曾/
2 GIVN 明
2 SURN Zēng 曾
2 _MARNM KHOO 邱
2 NICK 讳: 明
2 NICK 字: 永在
2 NICK 号: 迁荣
1 NAME Zēng Míng 曾明, 讳: 明, 字: 永在, 号: 迁荣, 126, 114, 61, 57, 22,9, 1世
1 SEX M
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Long San Khoo Clan (龍山邱氏), the Khoos (邱) of Sin Aun Village (新垵村) and the Leong San Tong Khoo Kongsi (龍山堂邱公司), Penang have the same progenitor, who is Khoo Chian Eng (Qiū Qiān Róng) (邱迁荣).  迁荣 is the Hào (号) name, 
2 CONC the Zì (字) name is Yǒng Zài (永在) while the Hu (讳) name is Míng (明). Zēng Míng (曾明) was adopted by the Qiu “丘”family. His descendants continue to recognize Lóng Shān Zēng (龍山曾) as their ancestor. Zēng Míng (邱明) was the fourth son o
2 CONC f Céng Chāng (曾昌) and the fifth descendent of Céng Guāng Chuò (曾光绰). .  
2 CONT
2 CONT Sin Kang Seah (新江社), Sin Aun Village (新垵村), Sam Toh District (三都), Hai Teng County (海澄 县), Chiang Chew Prefecture (漳州府), Hokkien Province (福建省), China (中国).  Sin Kang Seah (新江社) is presently the Sin Aun Village (新垵村) in Xing Lin D
2 CONC istrict (杏林镇), Xing Lin Town (杏林区), Xiamen (厦门). The Romanization are in Minnan Fujian dialect.
2 CONT
2 CONT  “Re Xing Lin District (杏林镇), Xing Lin Town (杏林区), Xiamen”. Kang Seah (新江社), Sin Aun Village (新垵村), Sam Toh District (三都), Hai Teng County (海澄 县) turned out not to be a Sin Kang Seah (新江社) or Sin Aun Village (新垵村) in Xing Lin Dist
2 CONC rict. This indeed happens a lot, that places turn out to be different from the records that people have been keeping .
2 CONT  Xing Lin (杏林) actually does not exist anymore (administrative jurisdiction changes over the years). Today’s name for what used to be Sin Kang Seah (新江社) is actually Xinyang neighborhood / 新阳街 道, in Haicang district / 海沧区, Xiamen.
2 CONT
2 CONT From Zeng Zupu: 昌公四子 生子 大發  一云明公人贅新安邱家又娶蘇氏生子晚成(名本?)成生子大發及正發大發早逝有子勝宗與叔正發先姓邱後姓曾俱不可現子孫覆姓邱曾
