2 CONT 	Apr 14, 2022, 12:20 PM
2 CONT
2 CONT "If you don't mind could I share this information with my distant Grandaunty who is a Khoo and she hails down from Khoo Hun Tee, the child of from the union of Khoo Thean Teik and Petronilla Goudyn. So, Khoo Hun Tee is her Grandfa
2 CONC ther, her father is Khoo Hooi Haw and her uncle is Khoo Hooi Leong. So, from Khoo Hooi Haw and Lucy Chin, we have my Grandaunty called Juliana Khoo and her siblings. 
2 CONT Grandaunty Juliana is today in her 80's and she is married to Chris Lee and they have 2 children - Anita and Allan Lee. Anita is married to Stuart Kerr and they have Tristan and Chloe Kerr. Allan is married to Prestinne Tan and th
2 CONC ey have no children. "
2 CONT
