2 CONT http://eresources.nlb.gov.sg/newspapers/Digitised/Article/straitstimes19170511-1.2.66?ST=1&AT=search&k=tan%20sian%20chin&P=6&Display=0&filterS=0&QT=tan,sian,chin&oref=article
