1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://mymindisrojak.blogspot.com/2020/09/khoo-koon-liat-and-family-bukit-brown.html
2 CONT See AnonymousNovember 3, 2020 at 4:06 PM comment:
2 CONT Hi, this might be of interest to you:
2 CONT
2 CONT Khoo Koon Liat's father, Khoo Thiam Hock, and mother, Ang Seok Chin, were also buried at BBC.
2 CONT
2 CONT Khoo Thiam Hock was born to Khoo Swee Yeow and Tan Geok Lin in 1875. He was the eldest son (unsure if he's the 1st child) and had 3 brothers, Khoo Thiam Teck, Khoo Thiam Swee and Khoo Guan Chiang, and 4 sisters whose names are unk
2 CONC nown.
2 CONT
2 CONT References:
2 CONT https://tombs.bukitbrown.org/2018/12/khoo-thiam-hock.html
2 CONT Ang Seok Chin is buried at BB Blk 4C tomb no. 115
