1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Chia Keng Chin retired as Campradore of Merchantile Bank after 45 years of service at the age of 65 in 1951. Good in sports, he played tennis and competed in swimming. Chia Keng Chin passed away at the age of 88 on
2 CONC  September 19, 1975 leaving behind his wife Lim Kim Neo, son George Chia Boon Swee, daughters: Molly Chia (Mrs Tan Teow Bok), Rosie Chia Siew Neo and Ivy Chia Keok Neo.  Madam Lim Kim Neo passed away at the age of 92 on April 26, 
2 CONC 1984.
2 CONT
2 CONT Residence: Grasslands, 8, St. Thomas Walk / Straits Hunting Party
2 CONT
