2 DATE JUL 1914
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://bukitbrown.com/main/?p=8556#comment-29048
2 CONT
2 CONT Ee Tean Choon (E Tean Choon on tombstone)
2 CONT
2 CONT Ee Tean Choon  born in the year 1910 and was the first born of  Ee Yean Keat and  Seow Joo Neo of No.350 East Coast Road. He was the eldest of seven children. He married  Ruby Chia Boey Neo , the fifth daughter of Mr & Mrs Chia Ke
2 CONC ng Chin of No.8 Saint Thomas Walk, on the 3rd of October 1936. Chia Boey Neo the grand-daughter of Mr Chia Hood Theam, was born in July 1914 and was 22 years old when she married Ee. They didn’t have their own children but adopted
2 CONC  two babies -Willie Ee Kean Leong and Margaret Ee.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sadly,  Ee Tean Choon died of typhoid, on the 3rd of April 1938, at just  28 years old. He left behind a young widow and two infants, barely two years after his marriage. The two infants were then adopted by his brother, Ee Tean C
2 CONC heng   and the young widow returned to her  parents’ house.
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscribed on the tomb is an epitaph :
2 CONT
